SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU LVRT - Colebrook Tavern Ride (30R/14R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Bruce Black\
 n\n**PLEASE NOTE THE START TIME**\n\n* An enjoyable ride starting and endi
 ng at Lebanon Valley Rail Trail - Cornwall Trailhead and exploring the Cor
 nwall and Mt. Gretna area. There will be an alternative start for those wh
 o want less mileage at the Lebanon Valley Rail Trail parking area on Coleb
 rook Rd. This alternative start is at the 7-mile mark of the course on the
  RideWith GPS map in the link below. **We will leave the 30-mile start at 
 9:30 and leave the alternate start at 10.** We will stop at Colebrook Tave
 rn for lunch and then meander back to the parking lot via the Lebanon Vall
 ey Rail Trail. The pace will be 13 - 15 mph average with multiple regroup 
 points (like 4 or 5).\n\nThis ride is a social ride\, but cyclists are not
  expected to stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortabl
 e paces. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking
  alone or being dropped off the back of the last group.\n\nCue and Ride wi
 th GPS links:\n[https://ridewithgps.com/routes/54714924](https://ridewithg
 ps.com/routes/54714924)\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bri
 ng 1-2 water bottles\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, 
 pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing a Meetup Member does not mean you are a club me
 mber. Use this link to join the club.\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/
 content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/
 content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to ab
 ide by the club's Code of Conduct [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/co
 ntent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclu
 b.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)
 \nand Rules of the Road\n[https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.asp
 x?](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=2
 57148&module_id=325159)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3148659
 79/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260519T204139Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260519T204139Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
