SUMMARY:Impromptu: LC Muggles Meander (22F) (11-12mph)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nThis is a "fun" ride no o
 ne will be left behind. Re-grouping stops as needed.\n\nRide leader: Jon H
 artung\nSweep: Heather Soistmann\n\nAnticipated Average Pace: 11-12 mph\n\
 nRoute: [LC Muggles Meander (22F) - Lancaster Bike Club](https://routes.la
 ncasterbikeclub.net/cue/lc-muggles-meander-22f/)\n\nThe ride leader will r
 ide at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride w
 ith a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best 
 to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may a
 lso be appointed at the start. Please do not join this ride if you are not
  willing to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will 
 be riding by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group.\n\nIf maintai
 ning a 11-12 mph average is beyond your current ability level\, please con
 sider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. P
 lease bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/
 CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we 
 require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being
  on Meetup does not mean you are a club member.\n\nJoin @ Lancasterbikeclu
 b.net -Member Signup. Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's C
 ode of Conduct: Code of Conduct Guidance if an incident occurs: Incident A
 ctions
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3149253
 90/
